<title>FRANCE: TABLE-THOMSON-CSF H1 SALES RISE SLIGHTLY.</title>
<headline>TABLE-THOMSON-CSF H1 SALES RISE SLIGHTLY.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover				16,405 vs    16,437</p>
<p>	 of which first quarter	   9,528 vs     9,367</p>
<p>NOTE - Thomson-CSF gave the results in the official bulletin BALO. It said that sales increased 0.6 percent on a comparable structural and exchange rate basis. On an identical structural basis, stripping out in particular its computer maintenance unit Thomainfor sold in February, sales rose 2.4 percent. -- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
